      "text": "/skill:tidy-recipe-authoring\n\nCreate tidy recipes for workbook `9fd38cfca91c5a601b40d2a5e3d85eb875630cc600ecceb3e7ee37f0f5d64340--criminal-courts-2022-23-cube-1-source.xlsx`.\n\n- Publication: Criminal Courts, Australia (Australian Bureau of Statistics)\n- Release or year: 2022\n- Sheets needing a recipe: 7 of 7\n\n| sheet | sheet_sha256 | current recipe |\n|---|---|---|\n| \"Contents\" | 4fe8559f5687abd71533c69e6dde4acc3202a501cc6d6bd4d59aab05f8a6ee59 | missing |\n| \"Table 1\" | 9acc68571fd506a0dd3b1fe260ebb6a8eeb6c14d8d725f454bf401e80c670640 | missing |\n| \"Table 2\" | 31399d358581e3cd178c239fd76eda6fc0e5187d71c6ece056e25e71ab758e5e | missing |\n| \"Table 3\" | ff97ccac278adc2867e27bf1c1d5df1e184a073dcdee1ff1ec8f1c94641f756b | missing |\n| \"Table 4\" | d2a0f5c16e4f9689c749c5d659adf53ccd9f8ef96129f9cf4026ebda2b952f5c | missing |\n| \"Table 5\" | c53a5956d2d61ff87b2a0d22a83de822d63eb7f7117155c311388e4437c3005e | missing |\n| \"Table 6\" | 0457f64432ca731c30f60d333ab2f1f983d00fb8a1c2e2fa1fd1a230783ff7e4 | missing |\n\nRelated workbooks:\n- A normalized copy of this workbook exists (9a9a18151fc6ccb58fa831a0628f13cd867486873b206ae32e4ab327bd903eba). Layout should match.\n\nWork through every sheet listed above using the skill's workflow. Use\n`codemode` scripts to call the recipe tools, and batch the work: for example,\nlist the workbook and check templates for all sheets in one script, then read\ngrids and test recipes a few sheets at a time. Keep script output short.\n\nName dimensions from `dictionary/dimensions.csv` (see the skill's\n`references/naming.md`); declare any name it lacks in `new_dimensions`.\n\nWrite each recipe to `tidy-recipes/<sheet_sha256>.json` and finish every sheet\nwith `submit_recipe`. You may only write recipe files for this workbook.\n\nEnd with one line per sheet: `sheet | kind | status | records | remaining failures`."
